0560:     """
0561:     Draw a line starting at (r,c) either to an endpoint or by (length,direction).
0562:     Modifies grid in-place. Returns (r_end,c_end) last drawn.
0563: 
0564:     Compatibility note (seed helpers):
0565:       - If you provide `direction` and leave `length=None`, the line extends until
0566:         it would leave the grid (implemented by using a sufficiently large length).
0567:     """
